OL,4,Awarning 'don't let this happen again'  
OL,6,FKurtaj had pleaded guilty last Monday  
OL,7,Fat Woolwich Crown Court to the Rockstar
OL,8,Fhack and a handful of others which he  
OL,9,Fcarried out when he was 16 and 17 years
OL,10,Fold with the hacking gang Lapsus$.     
